infographic list-grid-badge-card
design
  structure
    type list-grid
    columns 3
    gap 24
data
  title Six questions for a useful brief
  desc Independent checks, not a ranked score
  lists
    - label Audience
      desc Who needs this information?
    - label Message
      desc What should the reader remember?
    - label Evidence
      desc Which facts support the message?
    - label Structure
      desc What order makes the idea clear?
    - label Action
      desc What should the reader do next?
    - label Constraints
      desc What must remain unchanged?
theme
  colorBg #F8F5F3
  colorPrimary #3F6655
  palette #3F6655 #537A93 #A66F45 #865F7F #6A7A45 #8B6556
  base
    text
      font-family sans-serif
